{"type": "tool_call", "toolName": "wren_run_sql", "toolCallId": "call_00_HxN6Pm1dnjUnQu17Xx6J9048", "requestId": "01455ee7-23db-457e-9a27-276500e6dc31", "runId": "e74e1dfd-be2", "seq": 130, "toolInput": "{\"question\":\"对比正确口径（订单粒度有效订单总额）与错误口径（连接订单明细后累加订单金额）的差异\",\"group_id\":\"wren-gap-live-20261006-233059\",\"sql\":\"SELECT\\n  (SELECT SUM(o.amount_cents)/100.0\\n     FROM order o JOIN customer c ON o.customer_id = c.customer_id\\n    WHERE o.status = 'PAID' AND o.is_deleted = 0 AND c.is_internal = 0) AS correct_amount_yuan,\\n  (SELECT SUM(o.amount_cents)/100.0\\n     FROM order o JOIN customer c ON o.customer_id = c.customer_id\\n     JOIN order_item oi ON o.order_id = oi.order_id\\n    WHERE o.status = 'PAID' AND o.is_deleted = 0 AND c.is_internal = 0) AS wrong_amount_yuan,\\n  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM order_item) AS order_item_rows\"}"}
{"type": "tool_result", "toolName": "wren_run_sql", "toolCallId": "call_00_HxN6Pm1dnjUnQu17Xx6J9048", "requestId": "01455ee7-23db-457e-9a27-276500e6dc31", "runId": "e74e1dfd-be2", "seq": 131, "toolResult": "\"## wren 语义查询结果\\n\\n**知识库：** wren-gap-live-20261006-233059（group_id: `73b26360-df5c-497e-9137-bdfe7f50df67`）\\n\\n**查询问题：** 对比正确口径（订单粒度有效订单总额）与错误口径（连接订单明细后累加订单金额）的差异\\n\\n**SQL 语句：**\\n```sql\\nSELECT\\n  (SELECT SUM(o.amount_cents)/100.0\\n     FROM order o JOIN customer c ON o.customer_id = c.customer_id\\n    WHERE o.status = 'PAID' AND o.is_deleted = 0 AND c.is_internal = 0) AS correct_amount_yuan,\\n  (SELECT SUM(o.amount_cents)/100.0\\n     FROM order o JOIN customer c ON o.customer_id = c.customer_id\\n     JOIN order_item oi ON o.order_id = oi.order_id\\n    WHERE o.status = 'PAID' AND o.is_deleted = 0 AND c.is_internal = 0) AS wrong_amount_yuan,\\n  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM order_item) AS order_item_rows\\n```\\n\\n**查询结果：**\\n\\n| correct_amount_yuan | wrong_amount_yuan | order_item_rows |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| 1050.0 | 1950.0 | 9 |\\n\\n**数据文件：** data/5cccf2cb8559.csv（1 行 × 3 列；run_python 中 pd.read_csv('data/5cccf2cb8559.csv') 读取）\\n\""}
